[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Disconnect the front electrical connectors.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Body computer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223005100\">See M001 BODY COMPUTER</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the bolt and remove the body computer from its housing.</p><p>3. Disconnect the rear electrical connector.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Body computer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223005100\">See M001 BODY COMPUTER</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223002875.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Connect the rear terminal for the body computer.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Body computer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223005100\">See M001 BODY COMPUTER</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Place the body computer in position and tighten the fixing bolt.</p><p>Connect the front electrical connectors.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Body computer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223005100\">See M001 BODY COMPUTER</a></p></td></tr></table></div>"]]